    "solution": "$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Quotient Rule: } & \\dfrac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n} \\\\[0.8em]\n\\text{Application: } & \\dfrac{r^{10}}{r^2} = r^{10 - 2} = \\mathbf{r^8} \\\\[0.8em]\n\\text{Expanded Proof: } & \\dfrac{\\cancel{r \\cdot r} \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r \\cdot r}{\\cancel{r \\cdot r}} = r^8\n\\end{aligned}$$",
