    "solution": "$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{Part\\ A:}\\quad & 6y + 12 - 7y \\\\\n&= (6y - 7y) + 12 \\\\\n&= (6 - 7)y + 12 = \\mathbf{-y + 12} \\\\[1em]\n\\mathbf{Part\\ B:}\\quad & 9m^2 - 24m + 12m - 32 \\\\\n&= 9m^2 + (-24 + 12)m - 32 \\\\\n&= \\mathbf{9m^2 - 12m - 32}\n\\end{aligned}$$",
