    "problem": "### Summary of Cartesian Coordinates\n- **Quadrant I:** $(+, +)$ \u2014 Upper Right\n- **Quadrant II:** $(-, +)$ \u2014 Upper Left\n- **Quadrant III:** $(-, -)$ \u2014 Lower Left\n- **Quadrant IV:** $(+, -)$ \u2014 Lower Right\n- **$x$-axis intercept:** $(a, 0)$ where $y = 0$\n- **$y$-axis intercept:** $(0, b)$ where $x = 0$\n- **Origin:** $(0, 0)$ where both axes cross",
